		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2>There&#8217;s Always Something to See and Do</h2>
<p>All year long, Lancaster City is host to large festivals, cultural events, block parties, and more! Lancaster City’s special events help celebrate both the unique cultures and communities that call our city home and attract visitors here.</p>
<p>Monthly events like First Fridays and Music Fridays celebrate our thriving arts community featuring open-air markets, live performances, gallery openings, and more. Signature events like the Red Rose Run, Celebrate Lancaster, Hispanic Heritage Month, and the Mayor’s Tree Lighting are treasured traditions that can’t be missed.</p>

